<title>USA: Westpoint Stevens Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Westpoint Stevens Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>WEST POINT, Ga. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>WESTPOINT STEVENS INC</p>
<p>			     3 Mos ended 12/31    12 Mos ended 12/31</p>
<p>				   1996     1995	1996	1995</p>
<p>Net sales		    $455.0  $ 422.8  $1,723.8  $1,649.9</p>
<p>Net income, as adjusted  $ 19.3  $  15.9  $   57.7  $   47.9-a</p>
<p>Net income (loss)	  $ 19.3  $  15.9  $   57.7  $ (129.8)</p>
<p>Net EPS adjusted	   $  .61  $   .49  $   1.81  $   1.46-a</p>
<p>Net EPS			$  .61  $   .49  $   1.81  $  (3.97)</p>
<p>Avg shrs outstanding	 31.6     32.6	31.8	32.7</p>
<p>		    (In millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: /a Net income before amortization of excess reorganization value of $177.7 million, or $5.43 a share.</p>
<p>Operating earnings for the fourth quarter of 1996 increased 8.8% to $56.1 million, or 12.3% of sales, compared with operating earnings of $51.5 million, or 12.2% of sales, for the same period of 1995.</p>
</text>
